	"data": "GodSVG\n\nTool to create optimized Scalable Vector Graphics files, built in Godot.\nRepo: <https://github.com/MewPurPur/GodSVG>\nLicense: Check repo\nGodot version: 4.x\nStatus: Active, listed in awesome-godot\n\nWhat It Provides\nSVG creation and editing\nVector graphics tool built entirely in Godot\nNode-based editing of SVG elements\n\nRelevance\nVector graphics could be used for bubble icons, edge styling, and 2D UI elements in the spatial environment. The Godot-native SVG editor pattern shows how to…",
